    {
      "bbox": [
        73,
        507,
        1791,
        607
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "For the further improvement of communications, you are requested to take the following steps:",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 18,
          "mean": -0.3566,
          "min": -1.5359
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0008,
          "min": -0.0008
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 16,
          "mean": -0.0434,
          "min": -0.6933
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 6342,
        "area_px": 154900,
        "density": 0.04094,
        "chars": 93,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 14.66
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        73,
        644,
        1765,
        835
      ],
      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "1) During normal working hours, a period when there is no reason for any commissioner or agency head to be out of touch, carry out without exception the rule of leaving a telephone number with your secretary or responsible assistant.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 18,
          "mean": -0.4016,
          "min": -1.7649
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 2,
          "mean": -0.1127,
          "min": -0.2254
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 44,
          "mean": -0.008,
          "min": -0.3486
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 15100,
        "area_px": 292416,
        "density": 0.05164,
        "chars": 233,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 15.43
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        73,
        876,
        1895,
        1167
      ],
      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "2) After hours, observe whenever possible the practice of leaving the telephone number or address of where you are going. If there is no one at your residence qualified to receive calls, please leave the number with the night City Hall telephone operator. It should be remembered that it is by no means impossible for you to be paged and located even at a public dinner, or the theatre, although the need for this will occur very seldom, I am sure.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.3061,
          "min": -1.7141
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 2,
          "mean": -0.001,
          "min": -0.0019
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 91,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0029
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 28063,
        "area_px": 467055,
        "density": 0.06009,
        "chars": 448,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 15.96
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        73,
        1199,
        1807,
        1388
      ],
      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "3) The heads of operating agencies such as Police, Fire, Sanitation, Correction, Hospitals and Water Supply will continue, as in the past, to use the 24 hour facilities of their own departmental switchboards for the same purpose.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 20,
          "mean": -0.2704,
          "min": -1.3756
        },
        "category": {
